<title>USA: Tesoro Petroleum Q4 shr $1.59 vs $0.35.</title>
<headline>Tesoro Petroleum Q4 shr $1.59 vs $0.35.</headline>
<dateline>SAN ANTONIO, Texas 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996		     1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.59		    $0.35</p>
<p> Net			 42,600		    8,600</p>
<p> Revs		     300,200		  227,400</p>
<p>					    Year</p>
<p> Shr			  $2.81		    $2.18</p>
<p> Net			 74,500		   54,600</p>
<p> Revs		   1,039,800		1,002,900</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: The year's results benefited from a non-recurring gain of $60 million in the fourth quarter from settlement of a natural gas sales contract with Tennessee Gas Pipeline Co and other net favorable items of $4.6 million.</p>
<p>In 1995, results included a gain of $33 million from sale of certain interests in the Bob West field in South Texas, partially offset by a charge of $5 million for employee terminations and restructuring.</p>
<p>Tesoro Petroleum Corp.</p>
</text>
